{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06997","headline":"赠郑员外 · 陶翰","name":"赠郑员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"骢马拂绣裳，按兵辽水阳。\n西分鴈门骑，北逐楼烦王。\n闻道五军集，相邀百战场。\n风沙暗天起，虏骑森已行。\n儒服揖诸将，雄谋吞大荒。\n金门来见谒，朱绂生辉光。\n数年侍御史，稍迁尚书郎。\n人生志气立，所贵功业昌。\n何必守章句，终年事铅黄。\n同时献赋客，尚在东陵傍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陶翰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06997.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06997","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}